# Catalog schedule-only (law)

Read skill **forja-live-native-playback** when editing catalog/live packs, schedule ingest, or Providers.

**Law:** Catalog = match schedule only. Live packs discover + unlock streams.

| Catalog must not | Host must not |
|------------------|---------------|
| Emit `streams[]` / `iframe` / `embedUrl` | Promote catalog embeds into Providers |
| Implement `resolve` / unlock | Invent `pending:` Providers rows when discover is empty |
| Map `ev.streams` into schedule rows | Require catalog iframe before live `resolve` |

**Allowed on catalog rows:** opaque `sources: [{ source, id }]` handoff keys (no url/iframe), plus schedule fields / `broadcastChannels`.

Issue: [254](../../docs/issues/fixed/254-[fixed]-live-catalog-schedule-only-no-streams.md) · native play: [no-embed-playback.mdc](./no-embed-playback.mdc).
